+menuconfig DRIVERS_DISTANCE_SENSOR_TOF_SENSE_MS
+	bool "tof_sense_ms"
+	default n
+	---help---
+		Enable support for the Nooploop TOFSense / TOFSense-F / TOFSense-S
+		and TOFSense-M / TOFSense-MS laser range finders (NLink UART
+		protocol).
+
+		The driver streams frames from a standard PX4 serial port
+		(selected with SENS_TOFMS_CFG in QGC), validates the NLink
+		checksum, filters invalid zones, reduces the 8x8 / 4x4 zone map
+		of the M/MS series to a single distance and publishes it on the
+		distance_sensor uORB topic for EKF2.
